# armour/shared/pauldron_flame4_r: the large FLAME pauldron on the right shoulder (flame.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# blackened plate whose rim licks up into flame tongues, the tall one curling toward the neck, a crack down the
# plate (MYTHIC); the tongues' roots and the crack are its seams (amber from T6).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the rim under the tongues, G the plate's ember, N the tongues' roots and the crack, P the plate.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The rest views repeat as `when shoulder-flame` overlays: the shape's own drawing, which the body's cut skips.
use person
role pauldron flame.4
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

